OL,3,GNEWSAPublic used ladders to rescue
OL,4,Apeople from flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the public used ladders to
OL,7,Fsave people trapped inside a burning
OL,8,Fbuilding in Warwickshire on Saturday, a
OL,9,Fresident has said.
OL,11,FSix fire engines were called to
OL,12,FHusbandmans Close, in
OL,13,FShipston-on-Stour, shortly before 20:00
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FTwo people were taken to the Queen
OL,17,FElizabeth Hospital for further
OL,18,Ftreatment- a woman in critical
OL,19,Fcondition and a man with very serious
OL,20,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
