OL,3,GNEWSAPublic used ladders to rescue
OL,4,Apeople from flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was sat inside watching TV and I
OL,7,Fheard an almighty bang, I've opened my
OL,8,Fflat door, looked left and the bottom
OL,9,Fof the stairs are engulfed in flames,"
OL,10,Fsaid Simon Hudson, one of the
OL,11,Fresidents.
